From: verkur46 <mohamadrezasahami1999@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 01:46:00 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 020/230] Unify prediction windows and open the gate on the
 real lineup signal
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The hub and the match page each re-derived which mechanics were tappable, so
cards stayed live after kickoff and the lineup gate could lag ESPN's XI by a
full sync sweep. One clock-injected state machine now drives both, windows
self-describe their lineup requirement, the published check falls back to
recorded starters, and a tighter near-kickoff poll opens the gate within
minutes. Dead teaser strings and the stale lock-window docs go too.

